{"id":"99692e42c411db77","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound.md","title":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound — minimal dfa pumping bound","display":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound — minimal dfa pumping bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound","display":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound — minimal dfa pumping bound","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound","73-definition-3.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound — minimal dfa pumping bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-minimal-dfa-pumping-bound</span><span>73-definition-3.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pump}\">\\(\\mathrm{pump}\\)</span> 分别在机器类型和正则语言类型上调用；它保留原文的状态数/最小状态数含义，不改成最小可泵长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pump}(M)\\coloneqq|Q|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pump}(M)\\coloneqq|Q|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pump}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{|Q|:\\exists\\delta,q_0,F\\;((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pump}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{|Q|:\\exists\\delta,q_0,F\\;((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正则性保证候选状态数集非空，且其中元素均为正整数，故最小值存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}$，$L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}$，见 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{DFA}$，$L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}$，见 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]、[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]。","e